  "task": {
    "objective": "Deliver each vessel's parcel to its private berth on the opposite bank. Own completion pays 0.75 plus a public 0.25 per completion to every role, creating both urgency and shared benefit.",
    "natural_termination": "All three vessels are resolved (delivered or fuel-stranded), or the 80-step horizon truncates. Service lasts two later transitions. A natural resolution at H has priority.",
    "interaction": "Public directional requests allocate short exclusive entrance leases before simultaneous movement. Traffic can block, reserve, yield or strand others. The lower crossing closes for half of each eight-step tide cycle; one-vessel berths retain service occupancy for two steps.",
